# shell: desktop
# prefs: factory
# The calculator starts through the real application runner, publishes its
# own menu over the wire, and closes from the row in it.  Its arithmetic,
# checksums and controls are test_calculator's.
wait 20
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Development
wait 4
menu-pick Developer Calculator
wait 100
expect-title Developer Calculator
key f
key f
wait 10
shot /tmp/trk_calculator.png
note the strip carries the application's own menu, from the description
note that came down the wire for its window
click 60 8
wait 8
expect-menu Close
menu-pick Close
wait 30
expect-no-title Developer Calculator
